cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: risksieve
abstract: >-
  A Rust library that sieves predictions and decisions through
  finite-sample and anytime-valid conformal risk guarantees, unifying
  classical conformal risk control, anytime-valid conformal risk control,
  non-monotonic conformal risk control, and SCoRE-style selective
  deployment.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-07-27"
license: "MIT OR Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kent-tokyo/risksieve"
authors:
  - alias: kent-tokyo
    name: kent-tokyo
